d 'STATA-MCP': Stata MCP — drone and ado command suite
d
d Stata side of the Stata MCP project: the drone (runs inside Stata's
d JVM) and the ado commands. The MCP server is a separate executable
d (stata-mcp-server) that is not part of this package — after net install,
d run mcp_setup, install to fetch it and connect.
d
d Author: mhjung0822
d Support: https://github.com/mhjung0822/stata-mcp
d Distribution-Date: 20261117
d
d Requires: Stata 17 or higher (18+ recommended; bundled Java is used for the drone)

F stata-drone.jar
F mcp_connect.ado
F mcp_server.ado
F llm.ado
F graph_meta_put.ado
F mcp_load_serset.ado
F mcp.ado
F mcp.dlg
F mcp_menu.ado
F mcp_setup.ado
F mcp_uninstall.ado
F mcp_watchdog.ado
F mcp_analysis_setup.ado
F mcp_proc.ado
